      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've also experienced this first-hand. No VRC+ gift animation played, no hype train start or completion was triggered from a 100 drop. People seemed oblivious of getting a month of VRC+. There was no VRC+ Hype Train ongoing when this gift drop started.\n\nThe VRC+ gifter disconnected.\n\nThe VRC+ Hype Train requirement was reduced from 100 gifts to 50 gifts today. (10 prerelease → 100 → 50)\n\n```\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:37 Debug      -  [String Download] Attempting to load String from URL 'https://assets.vrchat.com/content-hub-upload/Config.json'\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:38 Debug      -  Received Notification: <Notification from username:Noc VR, sender user id:usr_cca50d37-d11c-4f09-b1f8-760e9bbb8f23 to usr_6fa4abc5-9952-4a0a-97de-b3598fbf6a5c of type: vrcplus, id: not_2a08c5e8-08c9-47f6-976a-aa6c191ce566, created at: 06/03/2026 02:32:35 UTC, details: {{VRCPlusGift=True}}, type:vrcplus, m seen:False, message: \"Noc VR has gifted you 1 months of VRC+!\">\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:38 Debug      -  Checking For Active VRChat+ Subscription\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:38 Debug      -  Get VRChat Subscription Details! Subscription Id:vrchatplus-100-gift-bundle-onemonth active:True desc:VRC+ Single Month Gift Bundle (100)\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:39 Debug      -  Fetched local user permissions\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:39 Debug      -  Unloading bundle aab_ec6c45c5-bbeb-4d81-91ce-5aaebba2a8d0\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:43 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnPlayerLeftRoom\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:43 Debug      -  [Behaviour] OnPlayerLeft Noc VR (usr_cca50d37-d11c-4f09-b1f8-760e9bbb8f23)\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:43 Debug      -  [<color=#1F84A9>A</color><color=#A3A3A3>T</color> <color=#ffa500>DEBUG</color> \t<color=#ffaa66>TVManagedWhitelistUI (ManagedWhitelistUI)</color>] Updating UI\n\n2026.06.03 02:32:43 Debug      -  [<color=#1F84A9>A</color><color=#A3A3A3>T</color> <color=#ffa500>DEBUG</color> \t<color=#ffaa66>TVManagedWhitelistUI (ManagedWhitelistUI)</color>] Removing 1 extra child entries\n\n2026.06.03 02:32